Z||000000||Tigger||09-06-2001||07:49 PM||||I just recieved the MI Fiero club newsletter and see that the club is having a Picnic at Fitzgerald Park in Grand Ledge MI (10mi west of Lansing) on September 22nd.<P>Well as most of you know, ChopTop, MooCow, Fieromaster88, FieroJoe, StansGT, jch82, FieroKyle, Nashco, Tigger (me), and many others were planning another get together that Saturday at Frances Park in Lansing on that day as well.<P>Would changing the meet to Sunday the 23rd work for everyone?  or maybe move it to the next weekend?  I was unaware of the club picnic date until today and don't want ours to interfere.  What sounds good?  BTW, all are welcome.<P>Brent<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 09-09-2001).]||||reg||1
