Z||000003||Nashco||09-07-2001||03:00 AM||||I'm fine if we get together on Sunday the 23rd.  I should have my new front poly, ball joints, 1" springs, and konis all in by then, so that would be a great test drive.  I can drive down these HORRIBLE freeways and see how stiff this thing really is <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  If we go the next weekend, I won't be able to attend because I'll be moving out...finals get over that Saturday!  YEAH!!!<P>Keep us updated, and thanks a lot for taking charge of the situation Tigger!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
