Z||000008||FieroMaster88||09-08-2001||09:40 AM||||Well..Stan and I will be there.  I will have my new clutch in by then.  My car has no engine, trans or cradle at the moment..took it out so it was easier to fix the clutch and my massive exhaust leak.  So my engne should look like it has 40,000 miles on it...not billions of miles on it.  Will look like it belongs!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">            <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo||||reg||14
