Z||000015||Tigger||09-09-2001||11:46 PM||||Joe, figured like you said that we'd all join up at Frances Park Saturday morning and then caravan over to Fitzgerald park together.  That's ok with me.<P>Brent<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 09-09-2001).]||||reg||1
