Z||000020||ChopTop||09-10-2001||12:28 PM||||Two days, two events!!<BR>September 22, Saturday, Fitzgerald Park Picnic (bring dish to pass), Grand Ledge. Sponsered by the Michigan Fiero Club. If interested in caravaning, some folks are meeting at Frances Park in Lansing at 8:30 (near the pavillion).  Travel time is approximately 30 minutes.  May or may not be open to all, but I would think potential new members would be welcome. I may make up some flyers and distribute for our Sunday get together.<BR>September 23, Sunday.  Frances Park (Lansing) get together.  Everyone is welcome.  2pm-5pm.  I'm going to assume this will be a small get together and I will provide hamburgers, buns, and condiments, otherwise it's BYOStuff.  Look for the small parking lot right near a entrance/exit area.  We should have it to ourselves.  It was great last time, low key and very relaxing, hope to see everyone again.||||reg||1
